# The v10 arm creates the alert_episodes table by that exact name (ADR-0009).
# Misnaming it lets the migration and version bump succeed while the table the
# episode store will read/write is absent — the a_v1 table-list check and the
# interrupted-migration recovery check both catch it. Guards the JSON-in-detail
# episode store WS1a builds on this table.
